### 2️⃣ RECIPE FRAMEWORK — CORE ARCHITECTURE

**`recipe/`** contains the entire agent recipe system organized into 4 sub-folders:

#### 📄 **`recipe/instructions/`** — Agent Instruction Prompts (Markdown)
Agent role definitions with `sub_mas-*` naming convention:

| Category | Agents |
|----------|--------|
| **Framework** | `sub_mas-framework-knowledge`, `sub_mas-framework-scanner` |
| **Recovery** | `sub_mas-recovery-checkpoint`, `sub_mas-recovery-defib`, `sub_mas-recovery-immune`, `sub_mas-recovery-safezone`, `sub_mas-recovery-timeline` |
| **Testing** | `sub_mas-pre-push-validator`, `sub_mas-python-repair`, `sub_mas-recipe-designer` |
| **IM (Improvement)** | `sub_mas-im-designer`, `sub_mas-im-finder`, `sub_mas-im-rank`, `sub_mas-im-session-reader`, `sub_mas-im-validator` |
| **Self-audit** | `sub_mas-self-auditor`, `sub_mas-config-auditor` |
| **Operations** | `sub_mas-bootstrap`, `sub_mas-generic-init`, `sub_mas-mas-controller`, `sub_mas-workflow-engine` |
| **Content** | `sub_mas-content-writer`, `sub_mas-doc-generator`, `sub_mas-email-campaign-manager` |
| **Security** | `security-scanner`, `static-analyzer` |
| **Specialized** | `sub_mas-prompt-engineer`, `sub_mas-seo-researcher`, `sub_mas-social-media-manager`, `sub_mas-web-researcher`, `sub_mas-intention-parser`, `sub_mas-summarizer`, `sub_mas-interpreter` |
| **Teams/Demo** | `demo-team/code-reviewer`, `demo-team/sub_mas-demo-runner` |
| **Governance** | `sub_mas-master-constitution`, `sub_mas-master-constitution-team`, `sub_mas-agent-guardian`, `sub_mas-yaml-editor`, `sub_mas-yaml-immune` |
| **Health** | `sub_mas-health-reporter`, `sub_mas-system-knowledge`, `sub_mas-goose-expert`, `sub_mas-session-analyst` |
| **Packaging** | `sub_mas-team-packager`, `sub_mas-migration-helper` |

#### 📄 **`recipe/sub/`** — Agent YAML Definitions
Corresponding YAML recipes for each agent (e.g., `sub_mas-framework-finder.yaml`). Key groups:

| Sub-directory | Content |
|---------------|---------|
| `sub/demo-team/` | Code review pipeline agents (director, orchestrator, synthesizer, validator, reporter) + demo runner |
| `sub/legacy/` | Empty (legacy placeholder) |
| `sub/template/` | `agent_template.yaml` — base agent template |

#### 📄 **`recipe/multi-arch-30/`** — 30-Agent Multi-Architecture Orchestration

| Sub-directory | Content |
|---------------|---------|
| `sub/` | Team task YAMLs (5 teams × 5 stages each) |
| `teams/` | Team definitions (code-review, data-quality, doc-gen, perf-eval, refactor, security-scan) |
| `template/` | `agent_template.yaml` |
| `test-r11021/` | 17 test scenarios (a1-a5, e1-e4, r1-r6, smoke) |
| Root | `multi-arch-30.yaml` — orchestrator recipe |

**Teams:**
- `code-review-team` (style, correctness, readability, perf, lead)
- `data-quality-team` (profile, validate, anomalies, enrich, report)
- `doc-gen-team` (analyze, skeleton, examples, crosslink, render)
- `perf-eval-team` (concurrency, cpu, io, memory, lead)
- `refactor-team` (simplify, extract, rename, patterns, decompose)
- `security-scan-team` (sast, secrets, deps, input, crypto)

